    end
    L3 -->|every action| L2
    L2 -->|MCP tool calls| L1
    L1 -->|operates on| HW[Bare-Metal Fleet]
    style L3 fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,stroke-width:2px
    style L2 fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px
    style L1 fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px
